Note on scope and third-party content:

The two specification excerpts in snippets/ are quoted from the RISC-V
Privileged ISA Specification, reproduced verbatim as supplied in the coding
challenge document, and are the copyright of RISC-V International. They are
included here as short quotations for the purpose of analysis.

Files under udb/ follow the conventions of riscv/riscv-unified-db, which is
licensed BSD-3-Clause-Clear. The header retained in udb/CACHE_BLOCK_SIZE.yaml
reflects the upstream file it corresponds to.

Raw model output committed under results/ is reproduced unedited as
experimental record.
